result
result-*
build/
*.z64
*.elf
*.sym
filesystem/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local-only Claude Code settings — not something a fresh clone should
# inherit from the repo, and not covered by this project's own gitignore
# until now (only excluded for existing checkouts via a global gitignore).
.claude/settings.local.json

# Agent scratch state, not project content.
.hermes/

# ./dev web --verify writes its screenshots and report here.
.webverify/

# tools/meshy.py's working directory and the two provenance trees it writes.
# `build/` above already covers the download; these are the raw drop it parks
# (2K albedo, PBR maps F3D cannot use, the task JSON) and any outgoing asset
# it displaced. Both are the provenance record, not a build input: what the
# ROM consumes is the small welded-and-coloured .glb committed under assets/.
# See tools/blender/meshy_bake.py.
archives/

# tools/meshy.py reads its API key from here and tells the user to create it.
# A paid key; never commit it.
.meshy_key
